@startuml
!include style.iuml
' Class diagram, part 2 of 4 (desktop client), figure (b): lockdown, ApiClient and the four
' API controllers it calls (Auth, Exams, Monitoring, Notifications). Figure (a) is class_diagram_client.puml.
' Only key members; parameters abbreviated as (..). Arrows: --> holds / creates, ..> calls or uses, *-- owns.
' A dashed white box is a class whose members are drawn in the other figure.
' Sources: Core/Lockdown/LockdownCoordinator.cs; Services/ApiClient.cs; Backend_API/Controllers (Auth, Exams, Monitoring, Notifications).
hide empty members
hide circle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam nodesep 22
skinparam ranksep 30
skinparam class {
  FontSize 14
  AttributeFontSize 14
  StereotypeFontSize 13
}
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
skinparam stereotypeFontSize 14

class ExamWindow <<Window>> #FFFFFF ##[dashed]
class LiveMonitoringService #FFFFFF ##[dashed]
class LockdownCoordinator #E8F0FB {
  -_keyboard : KeyboardHookService
  -_processes : ProcessGuardService
  -_clipboard : ClipboardGuardService
  -_devices : DeviceGuardService
  -_taskManager : TaskManagerGuard?
  -_violationSink : Action<string,string>?
  +Start(window)
  +Stop()
  +Suspend()
  +Resume()
}
class ApiClient #E8F0FB {
  +StudentLoginAsync(..)
  +RefreshAsync(..)
  +LogoutAsync(..)
  +ProbeHealthAsync(ct)
  +SubmitReadinessAsync(..)
  +StartExamAsync(..)
  +StartSessionAsync(..)
  +SaveAnswerAsync(..)
  +SubmitExamAsync(..)
  +SendHeartbeatAsync(..)
  +SendEventBatchAsync(..)
  +SendMonitoringEventAsync(..)
  +UploadCaptureAsync(..)
  +GetNotificationsAsync(..)
  +MarkNotificationReadAsync(..)
}

class AuthController <<api/auth>> #FFF6E0 {
  +StudentLogin()
  +Refresh()
  +Logout()
  +Health()  [/api/health]
}
class NotificationsController <<api/notifications>> #FFF6E0 {
  +GetMine()
  +MarkRead(id)
}
class ExamsController <<api/exams>> #FFF6E0 {
  +GetStudentCurrentExam()
  +SubmitReadiness(id, req)
  +StartStudentExam()
  +StartSession(id)
  +SaveAnswer(sessionId, req)
  +Submit(sessionId)
}
class MonitoringController <<api/monitoring>> #FFF6E0 {
  +Heartbeat(..)
  +PushEventBatch(..)
  +PushEvent(..)
  +UploadScreenshot(..)
}

ExamWindow --> LockdownCoordinator
LockdownCoordinator ..> LiveMonitoringService : ReportViolation\n(violationSink)

LockdownCoordinator --> ApiClient : fallback
LiveMonitoringService --> ApiClient

ApiClient ..> AuthController
ApiClient ..> ExamsController
ApiClient ..> MonitoringController
ApiClient ..> NotificationsController
AuthController -[hidden]right- ExamsController
ExamsController -[hidden]right- MonitoringController
MonitoringController -[hidden]right- NotificationsController

skinparam legendFontSize 14
legend bottom right
  <back:#E8F0FB>      </back>  Student<U+005F>Desktop<U+005F>App (WPF client).
  <back:#FFF6E0>      </back>  Backend<U+005F>API controllers (server: parts 3 and 4).
  Dashed box: members drawn in part (a). The view models,
  ReadinessCheckService and LiveMonitoringService (part a) also call ApiClient.
  Dashed arrows from ApiClient: HTTP(S) REST calls with a JWT.
endlegend
@enduml
